  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Variance of a set of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> numbers <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> is given<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>&#931;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>= 1</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math>, where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;is the average of the numbers.<br /><br />We want the variance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>48</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>52</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>98</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Here&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>51</mi></math>.<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;will be symmetric about&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>51</mn></math>,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8756;</mi><mspace width=\"0.5em\"/><msup><mi>&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>50</mi></mfrac><mspace width=\"0.5em\"/><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>..&#160;</mo><msup><mi>49</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>49</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>49</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>50</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>6</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>48</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>50</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mn>50</mn></mfenced><mfenced><mn>51</mn></mfenced><mfenced><mn>101</mn></mfenced></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>1</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>2</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo></mrow></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mn>50</mn></mfenced><mfenced><mn>51</mn></mfenced><mfenced><mn>101</mn></mfenced></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mn>25</mn></mfenced><mfenced><mn>26</mn></mfenced><mfenced><mn>51</mn></mfenced></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br />&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>42925</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>22100</mn></math><br /><br />&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>20825</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mspace width=\"0.5em\"/><msup><mi>&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>50</mi></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>20825</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>833</mi></math>"
  }
